  "steps": [
    "Rub all the pastry ingredients together quickly into a smooth dough.",
    "Butter the tart tin, roll out the pastry on a floured surface, line the tin, press the edges and trim.",
    "Cut the rhubarb into diamonds and lay them over the pastry. Heat the oven to 170 °C fan.",
    "Bring the Florentine ingredients briefly to the boil and set aside.",
    "Whisk the custard ingredients and pour carefully over the rhubarb.",
    "Bake 10 minutes, then spoon the Florentine almonds around the edge and bake another 20–25 minutes. Cool in the tin."
